# Downloaded / produced artifacts — never committed.
/game/*
/audio/*
/output/*
/base/*
/Z3/
*.zip

# Music pvms.bat fetches from a *_MUSIC_URL and caches here (with a .part sibling
# mid-fetch). Not committed: these are third-party recordings the disc pulls at
# build time, exactly like the CD-DA audio above. music/loadCD.ogg stays tracked --
# its LOADING_MUSIC_URL is empty and it is the one audio source the repo ships,
# which is also why the loading cue's cache name is not loadCD.ogg: a fetch must
# never be able to overwrite a tracked source.
/music/caltheme.wav
/music/loadcd-fetched.ogg
/music/*.part
!Zaturn - Complete (USA) (Netlink Edition)/.gitkeep
**/*.bin

